             .                                                                  

      ***************************************************************           
       2000-PROCESO.                                                            
      ***************************************************************           

           PERFORM 2100-OBTENER-NUMERO-REGISTROS                                

      ** CONTROLAMOS QUE EXITAN CABEZAS PARA LAS POLIZAS                        
           IF WS-NUMREG NOT EQUAL ZEROES                                        

            COMPUTE WS-IMP-COMPLEMENTARIO =                                     
                    FUNCTION NUMVAL(X372N007-BONO) / WS-NUMREG                  

            COMPUTE WS-IMP-COMPLEMENTARIO =                                     
                    WS-IMP-COMPLEMENTARIO / 100                                 

           ELSE                                                                 

              SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                           
              SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE                                           
              MOVE '07'                TO X372N007-CRETORNO-S                   
              MOVE 'NO EXISTEN POLIZAS CON LOS CRITERIOS SELECCIONADOS'         
                TO X372N007-GERROR-S                                            
      *D*                                                                       
      *       DISPLAY ' WS-POLIZA ' WS-POLIZA                                   
      *       DISPLAY ' WS-POLIZA-AUX ' WS-POLIZA-AUX                           
      *F*                                                                       
              MOVE WS-B372N007         TO X372N007-GNOMPROG-S                   
              MOVE WS-POLIZA           TO X372N007-POLIZA-S                     

           END-IF                                                               
           IF NO-ERROR                                                          
              PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > WS-NUMREG                 
              SET NO-ERROR TO TRUE                                              
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY ' COMP1 ' WS-IMPCOMP1(I)                                     
      *    DISPLAY ' COMP2 ' WS-IMPCOMP2(I)                                     
      *    DISPLAY ' -----------'                                               
      *F*                                                                       
              MOVE WS-FECVENCIMIENTO(I)                                         
                TO WS-FECVENCIMIENTO-AUX                                        

                 IF WS-IMPCOMP1(I) NOT EQUAL ZEROS AND                          
                    WS-IMPCOMP2(I) NOT EQUAL ZEROS                              

                   SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE                                      
                   SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                      
                   MOVE '08'                TO X372N007-CRETORNO-S              
                   MOVE 'ERROR:EL EXPEDIENTE YA TIENE COMPLEMENTARIOS IN        
      -                 'FORMADOS'                                              
                     TO X372N007-GERROR-S                                       
                   MOVE WS-B372N007         TO X372N007-GNOMPROG-S              
                   MOVE WS-POLIZA-AUX       TO X372N007-POLIZA-S                
                   MOVE WS-ANIO(I)          TO X372N007-ANIO-S                  
                   MOVE WS-KEXPEDIENTE(I)   TO X372N007-KEXPEDIENTE-S           
                   MOVE WS-FECVENCIMIENTO(I)                                    
                     TO X372N007-FECVENCIMICAP-S                                
                   COMPUTE X372N007-IMPORTE-S =                                 
                       FUNCTION NUMVAL (X372N007-BONO)                          
                   COMPUTE X372N007-IMPORTE-S =                                 
                       X372N007-IMPORTE-S / 100                                 
                   MOVE 'E'                 TO X372N007-TIPOIMPORTE-S           

                 ELSE                                                           
      * CONTROLAMOS QUE TENGA UN RENDIMIENTO INTEGRO CAPITAL DISTINTO           
      * DE CERO                                                                 
                   IF WS-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP(I) NOT EQUAL ZEROES                    
                      PERFORM 2200-ACTUALIZA-COMPLEMENTARIO                     
                   ELSE                                                         
                      SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE                                   
                      SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                   
                      MOVE '11'           TO X372N007-CRETORNO-S                
                      MOVE 'EL RENDIMIENTO INTEGRO CAPITAL ES CERO'             
                        TO X372N007-GERROR-S                                    
                      MOVE WS-B372N007     TO X372N007-GNOMPROG-S               
                      MOVE WS-POLIZA-AUX   TO X372N007-POLIZA-S                 
                   END-IF                                                       

                 END-IF                                                         

              END-PERFORM                                                       

           END-IF                                                               
           IF X372N007-ANIO-S EQUAL ZEROS                                       
              MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S(1) TO X372N007-ANIO-S                        
              MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S(1) TO X372N007-KEXPEDIENTE-S          
           END-IF.                                                              

           CONTINUE.                                                            

      ***************************************************************           
       2100-OBTENER-NUMERO-REGISTROS.                                           
      ***************************************************************           
           INITIALIZE WS-X372M004                                               
               REPLACING ALPHANUMERIC DATA BY SPACES                            
                              NUMERIC DATA BY ZEROS                             

      * MOVEMOS EL CAMPO POLIZA DE LA COPY X372N005 A LAS VARIABLES AUX         
           MOVE X372N007-POLIZA       TO WS-POLI-AUX                            
           MOVE WS-POLIZA-AUX         TO WS-POLIZA                              
           MOVE '0000'                TO WS-SUBPOL                              
           MOVE 0                     TO WS-CERTIF                              

           MOVE 'CC'                  TO X372M004-OPERACION-E                   
           MOVE WS-POLIZA             TO X372M004-KPOLIZA-E                     
           MOVE WS-SUBPOL             TO X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-E                  
           MOVE WS-CERTIF             TO X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-E                

           MOVE 0 TO XN-J                                                       

           PERFORM UNTIL X372M004-SPAGINACION-S = 'N' OR ERROR-GRAVE            

      * MOVEMOS EL CAMPO POLIZA DE LA COPY X372N007 A LAS VARIABLES AUX         

              CALL WS-B372M004  USING WS-X372M004                               
      *D*                                                                       
      *        DISPLAY ' OPERACION-E  ' X372M004-OPERACION-E                    
      *        DISPLAY ' KPOLIZA-E    ' X372M004-KPOLIZA-E                      
      *        DISPLAY ' NSUBPOLIZA-E ' X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-E                   
      *        DISPLAY ' KCERTIFICADO ' X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-E                 
      *        DISPLAY ' CRETORNO-S   ' X372M004-CRETORNO-S                     
      *F*                                                                       

      *D*                                                                       
               DISPLAY ' RETORNO M004 ' X372M004-CRETORNO-S                     
               DISPLAY ' ANIO 1       ' X372M004-ANIO-S(1)                      
               DISPLAY ' ANIO 2       ' X372M004-ANIO-S(2)                      
      *F*                                                                       
              MOVE 1 TO XN-I                                                    

      * COMPROBAREMOS CUANTAS CABEZAS TIENE LA POLIZA, EL CONTADOR XN-I         
      * CONTROLA LOS EXPEDIENTES ENCONTRADOS MIENTRAS QUE XN-J CONTROLA         
      * LOS EXPEDIENTES QUE ADEMAS TIENEN EL RAMO IGUAL, QUE NO PUEDE           
      * EXCEDER DE DOS POR POLIZA.                                              

              PERFORM UNTIL XN-I > X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S OR                  
                            XN-I > 5 OR                                         
                            ERROR-GRAVE                                         

      * CONTROLAMOS LA PAGINACION                                               
                 IF X372M004-SPAGINACION-S = 'S'                                
                    MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S          (XN-I)                        
                      TO X372M004-ANT-ANIO-E                                    
                    MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S   (XN-I)                        
                      TO X372M004-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE-E                             
                 END-IF                                                         


      * CONTROLAMOS LA POLIZA A ACTUALIZAR                                      
      *          IF X372M004-KRAMO-S(XN-I)        EQUAL WS-RAMO AND             
                 IF X372M004-KPOLIZA-S(XN-I)      EQUAL WS-POLIZA AND           
                    X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-S(XN-I)   EQUAL WS-SUBPOL AND           
                    X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-S(XN-I) EQUAL WS-CERTIF               

      *D*                                                                       
      *       DISPLAY ' ENTRAMOSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS'                
      *       DISPLAY ' M004-KPERSONA1-S ' X372M004-KPERSONA1-S(XN-I)           
      *F*                                                                       

                    ADD 1 TO XN-J                                               
      * MOVEMOS LOS CAMPOS A LAS VARIABLES AUXILIARES                           
                    MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S(XN-I)         TO WS-ANIO(XN-J)         
                    MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S(XN-I)                           
                      TO WS-KEXPEDIENTE(XN-J)                                   
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPREDPRICAP-S(XN-I)                          
                      TO WS-IMPREDPRICAP(XN-J)                                  
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPREDTRANCAP-S(XN-I)                         
                      TO WS-IMPREDTRANCAP(XN-J)                                 
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP-S(XN-I)                       
                      TO WS-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP(XN-J)                               
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPCOMP1-S(XN-I)                              
                      TO WS-IMPCOMP1(XN-J)                                      
                    MOVE X372M004-KPERSONA1-S(XN-I)                             
                      TO WS-KPERSONA(XN-J)                                      
      *D*                                                                       
      *       DISPLAY ' IMPCOMP1 ' X372M004-IMPCOMP1-S(XN-I)                    
      *       DISPLAY ' IMPCOMP2 ' WS-IMPCOMP1(XN-J)                            
      *F*                                                                       
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPCOMP2-S(XN-I)                              
                      TO WS-IMPCOMP2(XN-J)                                      
                    MOVE X372M004-FECVENCIMICAP-S(XN-I)                         
                      TO WS-FECVENCIMIENTO(XN-J)                                

                    PERFORM 2105-CALCULO-PENDIENTE                              
                  END-IF                                                        

                  ADD 1 TO XN-I                                                 

               END-PERFORM                                                      

      ** CONTROLAMOS QUE NO TENGAN MAS DE DOS CABEZA POR POLIZA                 
              MOVE XN-J                     TO WS-NUMREG                        
      *D*                                                                       
      *       DISPLAY ' XN-J ' XN-J                                             
      *F*                                                                       

              IF XN-J > 2                                                       

                 SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                        
                 SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE                                        
                 MOVE 'N'                   TO X372M004-SPAGINACION-S           
                 MOVE '06'                TO X372N007-CRETORNO-S                
                 MOVE 'EXCEDIDO EL NUMERO MAXIMO DE CABEZA PARA LA POLIZ        
      -               'A'                                                       
                   TO X372N007-GERROR-S                                         
                 MOVE WS-B372N007         TO X372N007-GNOMPROG-S                
                 MOVE WS-POLIZA-AUX       TO X372N007-POLIZA-S                  

              END-IF                                                            

           END-PERFORM                                                          

           CONTINUE.                                                            

      ***************************************************************           
       2105-CALCULO-PENDIENTE.                                                  
      ***************************************************************           

           INITIALIZE WS-PENDIENTE-AUX                                          

           IF X372M004-FECPAGOCAPITAL-S(XN-I) EQUAL ZEROES                      
              COMPUTE WS-PENDIENTE-AUX   =                                      
                      X372M004-IMPCAPITAL-S(XN-I) +                             
                      X372M004-IMPBENEFICIOS-S(XN-I)                            
           ELSE                                                                 
              MOVE ZEROES  TO WS-PENDIENTE-AUX                                  
           END-IF                                                               

           IF X372M004-FECPAGCOMP1-S(XN-I) EQUAL ZEROES                         
              ADD WS-IMP-COMPLEMENTARIO     TO WS-PENDIENTE-AUX                 
           END-IF                                                               

           IF X372M004-FECPAGCOMP2-S(XN-I) EQUAL ZEROES                         
              ADD WS-IMP-COMPLEMENTARIO     TO WS-PENDIENTE-AUX                 
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE WS-PENDIENTE-AUX            TO WS-PENDIENTE(XN-J)               

