      *       DISPLAY ' COMP1 DISTINTO DE ZEROS'                                
      *       DISPLAY ' WS-IMPCOMP1(I) ' WS-IMPCOMP1(I)                         
      *F*                                                                       
           IF  WS-IMPCOMP1(I) EQUAL ZEROES                                      

               INITIALIZE WS-X372M001                                           
